Third-party software
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Scope of this list: the DIRECT dependencies of this repository as of
2026-10-02 (milestone M2), both the JavaScript packages installed by bun and
the Rust crates declared in apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml (versions from
Cargo.lock). Licence identifiers were read from each package's package.json /
Cargo.toml "license" field and copyright lines from its licence file.
Transitive dependencies are not listed yet; per docs/teardown.md section
13.4, this file will be generated from an SBOM (bun.lock for JavaScript,
cargo-about for the Tauri/Rust side) before the first release.

Components that land in later milestones (@modelcontextprotocol/server; LLM
SDKs) are NOT installed yet and will be added here when they are.

